{"articleNo":"106289","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=106289&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"생활관 만족도 설문조사 실시(푸름관, 신평관)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.05.12","hit":"2974","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>생활관 이용 편의 향상을 위해 운영 개선 방안을 마련하고자 설문조사를 실시하오니</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">관생 여러분 모두 참여하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ 대상 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">2014-1학기 푸름관 및 신평관 입사자 전체</font></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ 설문지 배부 : </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#0900ff\">2014. 5. 12(월) ~ 5. 13(화), <font color=\"#0900ff\">관생실로 배부함</font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ 설문지 제출일자 및 장소 : </span><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">푸름관 ☞ </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014. 5. 14(수) 점심시간, 푸름관 식당</font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신평관 ☞ </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014. 5. 14(수) 오전7시~10시, 신평관 관리실(경비실)</font></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※&nbsp;응답한 설문지를 제출하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">관생에게 특식으로 </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#0900ff\">단지우유(바나나맛)</font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">를 드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 제출시간에 지정된 장소에 제출한 자에 한함</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -식사선택제에서&nbsp;\"식사 안함\"을</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 선택한 관생도 설문지를 제출하면 특식 제공</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2014. 5. 12.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">생 활 관 장</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\">&nbsp;</div></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
